    cof:title "7 Application" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00002  Amendments relating to ACC dismissal powers  Schedule 1 Amendment of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Part 2  The Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979, as amended by this Part, applies in relation to the communication, use and making of a record of information, and the giving of information in evidence in proceedings, on or after the commencement of this item, whether the information was obtained before or after that commencement. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00002  Schedule 1  Amendments relating to ACC dismissal powers" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-2011-sch-1-sec-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8 Review of operation of amendments relating to serious"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-8 ;
    values:originalText "misconduct by staff member (1) The Minister must cause an independent review to be undertaken of the operation of section 47A of the Australian Crime Commission Act 2002, as inserted by this Schedule, and the amendments made by Part 2 of this Schedule. (2) The review must be undertaken as soon as practicable after the end of the period of 2 years after the commencement of this Schedule. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00002  Amendments relating to appointment of ACC examiners  Schedule 2" ;
    skos:definition "misconduct by staff member (1) The Minister must cause an independent review to be undertaken of the operation of section 47A of the Australian Crime Commission Act 2002, as inserted by this Schedule, and the amendments made by Part 2 of this Schedule. (2) The review must be undertaken as soon as practicable after the end of the period of 2 years after the commencement of this Schedule. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00002  Amendments relating to appointment of ACC examiners  Schedule 2"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "eddcd2e5d1cfcb314b06aad76aa9cced879cac9ff00f0c1542b72654ff0ae6fc" ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Review of operation of amendments relating to serious misconduct by staff member" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
