    values:originalText "ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00002  Schedule 2  Amendments relating to appointment of ACC examiners  The amendment made by item 5 of this Schedule applies to the appointment of an examiner after the commencement of this item, whether or not the person has previously been appointed as an examiner." ;
