concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-2011-sch-2-sec-17 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17 At the end of subsection 46H(2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-17 ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (e) the examiner (being a part-time examiner):  (i) engages in paid employment that, in the CEO’s opinion, conflicts or may conflict with the proper performance of his or her duties (see subsection 46G(2)); or  (ii) does not comply with a requirement under subsection 46G(3) (notifying the CEO of employment details)." ;
