concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-2011-sch-3-sec-19 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19 Subsection 3M(4)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-19 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (4) In determining the amount of compensation payable, regard is to be had to whether any of the following persons, if they were available at the time, provided any appropriate warning or guidance on the operation of the equipment:  (a) if the equipment was operated under a warrant issued in relation to premises—the occupier of the premises, or the occupier’s employees or agents;  (b) if the equipment was operated under a warrant issued in relation to a person—that person, or that person’s agents." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (4) In determining the amount of compensation payable, regard is to be had to whether any of the following persons, if they were available at the time, provided any appropriate warning or guidance on the operation of the equipment:  (a) if the equipment was operated under a warrant issued in relation to premises—the occupier of the premises, or the occupier’s employees or agents;  (b) if the equipment was operated under a warrant issued in relation to a person—that person, or that person’s agents."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "62bf118c2d096369531aa9f18d76207794ef7d813e73863209264d79db7b5326" ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Regard must be had to whether any person provided appropriate warning or guidance on the operation of equipment." ;
    dc:description "warning or guidance" ;
