concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-2011-sch-3-sec-23 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23 Application of this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-23 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendments made by this Part, other than items 14 and 22, apply in relation to any warrant issued in relation to a person after this Part commences. (2) The amendment made by item 14 of this Schedule applies in relation to any thing seized under Division 2 of Part IAA of the Crimes Act 1914, whether before or after this Part commences. (3) The amendment made by item 22 of this Schedule applies in relation to applications instituting proceedings in a court of competent jurisdiction that are made after this Part commences. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00002  Schedule 3  Amendment of the Crimes Act 1914" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The amendments made by this Part, other than items 14 and 22, apply in relation to any warrant issued in relation to a person after this Part commences. (2) The amendment made by item 14 of this Schedule applies in relation to any thing seized under Division 2 of Part IAA of the Crimes Act 1914, whether before or after this Part commences. (3) The amendment made by item 22 of this Schedule applies in relation to applications instituting proceedings in a court of competent jurisdiction that are made after this Part commences. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00002  Schedule 3  Amendment of the Crimes Act 1914"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5482c0b59eb6c39660227132067a2dc4e69c347bd5f8d8bf6c4734ff2d484a23" ;
    cof:pageNumber "19"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commences of amendments" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-act-2011.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-act-2011.pdf, p.19" ;
    cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-2011-sch-3-sec-23-norm .
