    values:originalText "The amendments made by items 30 to 39 of this Schedule apply to a thing seized or a document produced under Part IAA of the Crimes Act 1914, whether before or after this Part commences. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00002  Amendment of the Crimes Act 1914  Schedule 3 Amendments relating to retention etc. of things seized and documents produced  Part 2" ;
    skos:definition "The amendments made by items 30 to 39 of this Schedule apply to a thing seized or a document produced under Part IAA of the Crimes Act 1914, whether before or after this Part commences. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00002  Amendment of the Crimes Act 1914  Schedule 3 Amendments relating to retention etc. of things seized and documents produced  Part 2"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e3a3e569019aa06de54efd2f96584428676f2d18e2586f1203e6b305a4490ef4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "24"^^xsd:integer ;
