concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-2011-sch-3-sec-42 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "42 At the end of section 3ZW"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-42 ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (2) The Commissioner may delegate to a Commonwealth officer any or all of the Commissioner’s powers, functions or duties under Division 4C of this Part if the Commissioner is satisfied on reasonable grounds that the officer is able to properly exercise those powers, functions or duties. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00002  Schedule 3  Amendment of the Crimes Act 1914" ;
