    skos:prefLabel "12 Application of item 4"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-12 ;
    values:originalText "The amendment made by item 4 of this Schedule applies in relation to any special circumstances, whether occurring before or after this Schedule commences.  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— Senate on 29 September 2010 House of Representatives on 9 February 2011]  (210/10) ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00002" ;
